{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A7]From the [Dm]tribe of Dan [C]he [F]came
Son of A[Gm]hisamach by [A]name
Ap[Dm]pointed to work [C]with [F]Be[Am7/E]za[Dm]lel
To [Gm]build God's dwelling, to ful[Asus4]fill the [A]goal
I [Bb]have given skill to [C]every crafts[F]man
So [Gm]they can make what I have [Asus4]planned
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[A]Oho[Dm]liab, son of Ahi[Am/C]samach
Of the [Bb]tribe of Dan, a [F]skilled touch
En[Gm]gravers, designers, [Dm]weavers too
[A]Blue and purple, crimson hue
[Dm]Masters of every [Am7/C]craft and art
Cre[Bb]ating what is [F]in God's [Gm]heart [Asus4]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]The a[Dm]bility to teach [C]others [F]well
To [Gm]help them build, to help them [Asus4]tell
[A]All [Dm]the work of [C]the sanctuary
[F]Accord[Am7/E]ing to the [Dm]command of the [Gm]Lord
Moses called the skilled [Asus4]crafts[A]men
To [Bb]carry out the [C]sacred [Asus4][A]plan
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Oho[Dm]liab, son of Ahi[Am/C]samach
Of the [Bb]tribe of Dan, a [F]skilled touch
En[Gm]gravers, designers, [Dm]weavers too
[Asus4]Blue and purple, [A]crimson hue
[Dm]Masters of every [Am/C]craft and art
Cre[Bb]ating what is [F]in God's [Gm]heart [Asus4][A]
