{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]Wisdom and understand[C]ing filled their [Dm]hands
To [Bb]know how to [C]carry out the [Dm]plans
[Bb]Just as the [C]LORD had command[F][C/E]ed [Dm]
